  "question": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;moles of argon and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;moles of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>PCl</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></math> are introduced into an evacuated flask of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn></math> litre capacity at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>610</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>. The system is allowed to equilibrate. At equilibrium, the total pressure of mixture was found to be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>atm</mi></math>. The <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub></math> for the reaction is [Given : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>082</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math> atm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> ]",
